-- list
-- title: Version 0.9.7

- Set up the watcher to check for a
``.git/index.lock`` file. If it exists,
the hot reload does not trigger. This
is to prevent builds while git is
working on the directly. From what I
can tell this should work, but there
may be a race condition if multiple
git processes are run in succession. 

I'll address that if I see it.

- Fixed warnings from ``cargo clippy``




